          "en": "Cross-Region inference increases the availability of models with limited regional coverage, and the circuit breaker with controlled degradation prevents failures from propagating to the user. Extending timeouts, reprocessing manually, or concentrating the deployment in one Availability Zone do not provide operational continuity."
