        "explanation": {
          "es": "AWS Global Accelerator proporciona dos direcciones IP anycast estáticas, admite tráfico UDP y conmuta por error entre grupos de endpoints en cuestión de segundos sin depender del TTL de DNS. CloudFront y Route 53 dependen de DNS o solo admiten HTTP/HTTPS.",
          "en": "AWS Global Accelerator provides two static anycast IP addresses, supports UDP traffic, and fails over between endpoint groups within seconds without depending on DNS TTL. CloudFront and Route 53 depend on DNS or support only HTTP/HTTPS."
        }
