          "en": "A company will deploy third-party virtual SD-WAN appliances in a VPC to extend its software-defined network into AWS. It needs dynamic routing with BGP between the appliances and the transit gateway, with high bandwidth and without the overhead of managing IPsec tunnels for each appliance. Which solution meets these requirements?"
