          "en": "A central networking team must retain exclusive control of the route tables, the transit gateway attachments, and the CIDR blocks, while several application teams deploy EC2 instances and load balancers in their own AWS accounts. The team also wants to reduce private IP address consumption. Which solution meets these requirements?"
