          "en": "EventBridge can react to S3 events and start a SageMaker Pipeline, and an alarm on Model Monitor metrics makes it possible to trigger retraining when degradation is detected. Manual execution is not automated, CodeDeploy deploys applications, and Lambda concurrency has no bearing on retraining."
