          "en": "AWS WAF inspects HTTP/HTTPS requests at layer 7, and its managed rule groups cover SQL injection and XSS with no custom development. Network ACLs and security groups filter only by IP, port, and protocol, and GuardDuty detects threats but does not block traffic."
