          "en": "AWS Secrets Manager supports built-in automatic rotation for databases and encrypts secrets with AWS KMS, while an IAM role lets the application retrieve the secret without static credentials. Environment variables, S3 objects, and AMIs provide no automatic rotation and widen the exposure surface."
