          "en": "Security Hub with a delegated administrator and cross-Region aggregation automatically centralizes the findings from the integrated services, and an organization trail with Object Lock delivers an immutable audit record from all accounts. The other options require scripts, do not consolidate findings, or do not produce an immutable record."
