          "en": "A company runs 200 heterogeneous servers (Windows and Linux) in a data center and needs a disaster recovery strategy on AWS with an RTO of 30 minutes and an RPO of seconds, without licensing per-server replication software or keeping recovery EC2 instances running permanently. Which solution should the architect recommend?"
