          "en": "Read replicas distribute the queries and an ElastiCache cache eliminates the repeated reads before they reach the database, both without redesigning the data model. DAX works only with DynamoDB, the Multi-AZ standby instance does not serve reads, and Redshift is oriented to analytics, not to transactional catalog queries."
