          "en": "Per-zone NAT gateways, RDS Multi-AZ, and targets in multiple zones eliminate all three single points of failure by using managed services. Automatic recovery or a single-instance Auto Scaling group still depends on one zone, and an egress-only gateway applies only to IPv6."
