          "en": "A company must back up EC2 instances, EBS volumes, Amazon DynamoDB tables, and Amazon RDS instances from several accounts daily, retain the backups for 90 days, and keep a copy in a second Region for compliance. Which solution meets these requirements with the least operational effort?"
